    "Title": "Surprise Party",
    "TitleKey": "HeadHunters_ShipAmbush_VE_title_001",
    "Description": "Some numskull flying a <EM4>~mission(AmbushTarget)</EM4> was caught spying on our ops. We ran \u2018em off with a warning only to spot \u2018em doing the same shit someplace else. Since they didn\u2019t get the message, seems we gotta send a stronger one.    \n\nThere\u2019s an emission cloud near <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> that they fly by frequently. Primo place to power down, hide, and launch a surprise attack. Sometimes they fly solo, sometimes there\u2019s other single-seaters with them. It\u2019ll be all you for that first hit, but we\u2019ll put some support ships nearby to help finish the job. \n\nAnd if you needed some extra motivation, there's a bonus of <EM4>~mission(ScripAmount) Council Scrip</EM4> for the main contractor at the end of the job. \n\nStows out.",
    "DescriptionKey": "HeadHunters_ShipAmbush_VE_desc_001",
    "DisplayDescription": "Some numskull flying a <EM4>[AmbushTarget]</EM4> was caught spying on our ops. We ran \u2018em off with a warning only to spot \u2018em doing the same shit someplace else. Since they didn\u2019t get the message, seems we gotta send a stronger one.    \n\nThere\u2019s an emission cloud near <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4> that they fly by frequently. Primo place to power down, hide, and launch a surprise attack. Sometimes they fly solo, sometimes there\u2019s other single-seaters with them. It\u2019ll be all you for that first hit, but we\u2019ll put some support ships nearby to help finish the job. \n\nAnd if you needed some extra motivation, there's a bonus of <EM4>[ScripAmount] Council Scrip</EM4> for the main contractor at the end of the job. \n\nStows out.",
